      "description": "In response to persistent access denial and infrastructure vulnerability, decentralized academic and municipal networks across Germany, France, and the Netherlands begin pooling surplus GPU capacity into a federated compute grid. Initially used for non-sensitive research and local service automation, it demonstrates unexpected resilience and sparks interest in a sovereign, distributed alternative to hyperscaler dependency.",
